<title>USA: Arcadia merger will stabilize prices -- CEO.</title>
<headline>Arcadia merger will stabilize prices -- CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arcadian Corp's planned union with Potash Corp, the latest merger in a string of such moves in the fertilizer industry, will help decrease pricing volatility among commodity fertilizer products, said Doug Campbell, Arcadian's chief executive officer.</p>
<p>&quot;This (merger with Potash) boads very positive (for pricing stability in fertilizer products),&quot; Campbell said Tuesday in a conference call.</p>
<p>Campbell added he expects the merger with Potash to close in about four months.</p>
</text>
